ng:`C. User Accounts and Security`,body:`Certain features (membership, unlocks, comments, reviews, bookmarks) require an account. You are responsible for keeping your login credentials safe and confidential and for all activity under your account. You must provide accurate information and notify us promptly of any suspected unauthorised use. We may suspend accounts that violate these Terms.`},{heading:`D. Prohibited Conduct`,body:`You agree not to: attempt to access, copy, scrape, extract or redistribute story content in bulk; circumvent access, unlock, paywall or digital-use controls (including weekly allowances, video-ad gates or membership limits); impersonate others or interfere with other readers (harassment, spam, hate, illegal content in comments/reviews); attempt to disable, overload or reverse-engineer the App; or use automated tools/bots to read, capture or re-serve content.`},{heading:`E. Intellectual Property Rights`,body:`All story text, titles, characters, artwork, branding and other material in the App are the intellectual property of the author and are protected by copyright and other laws. Save for the limited licence in Section B, nothing in these Terms transfers any ownership or right to you. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.`},{heading:`F. No Republication`,body:`The story and its content may not be republished, copied, re-uploaded, mirrored, redistributed, broadcast or made available on any other site, platform, forum, social network, print or offline medium, in whole or in part, without the author's prior written permission. This includes but is not limited to posting full or partial text elsewhere and reformatting or re-presenting the content under any other title or on any other app. Republication without permission may give rise to a claim for damages and/or injunctive relief.`},{heading:`G. No Video, YouTube or Adaptations`,body:`No person may create or upload any video, YouTube video, explainer, summary, dramatic reading, audiobook, animation, illustration series, comic, translation-for-broadcast, or any other audio-visual or derivative adaptation or retelling of the story (or substantial portions of it) without the author's prior written permission. This includes reaction, commentary and spoiler channels that reproduce substantial narrative content. Screen-recording, streaming or broadcasting the App is also prohibited. For reproductions exceeding brief commentary for criticism you must seek written permission first.`},{heading:`H. Limitation of Liability — "AS IS"`,body:`The App and its content are provided 'AS IS' and 'AS AVAILABLE' without warranties of any kind, express or implied (including merchantability and fitness for a particular purpose). To the maximum extent permitted by law, we and the author shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages, or any loss of profits, data or goodwill, arising from or related to your use of, or inability to use, the App. Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.`},{heading:`I. Changes to Terms`,body:`We may update these Terms from time to time. Changes take effect when posted in the App. Your continued use after a change means you accept the revised Terms. We will date any revised version. It is your responsibility to review the Terms periodically.`},{heading:`J. Termination`,body:`We may suspend or terminate your access if you breach these Terms. You may stop using the App at any time. Sections governing ownership, content, liability, and conduct survive any termination.`},{heading:`K. Contact / Governing Law`,body:`Questions about these Terms: contact the App owner. These Terms are governed by applicable law. Thank you for reading and for respecting the author's work.`}];function nd(){let[e,t]=(0,H.useState)(!1),[n,r]=(0,H.useState)(!1),[a,o]=(0,H.useState)(!1),[s,c]=(0,H.useState)(!1);return(0,H.useEffect)(()=>{t(!0);let e=!1;try{e=sessionStorage.getItem($u)===`1`}cat